## Evidence discipline

- Cite facts inline: `[Source: SOW §4.2]`, `[Source: proposal p.3]`, `[Source: kickoff call 2026-10-02]`, `[Source: Salesforce opp]`.
- Label inference `hypothesis — validate`. Replace the label with a citation once a real conversation confirms it.
- When two sources disagree, keep both with citations and flag the conflict. Don't silently pick one.
- Never fabricate evidence. "No evidence found" is a valid finding.

