## What not to do automatically

- Don't run `kanon install`.
- Don't publish or share anything outside this repo without explicit go-ahead: shared docs, Slack posts, emails, Jira tickets. The Evo app goes out through `/publish` only, and running it is the go-ahead.
- Don't push, create repos, or change Evo app access outside `/publish`.
- Edit `onboard-client` marker blocks through `/onboard-client` (Add context / Re-baseline) so the engagement profile's change log stays accurate. If you hand-edit one, add a change-log row yourself.
